  "description": "DLMS/COSEM (IEC 62056) for IoTCom.Net: HDLC (62056-46) and TCP wrapper (62056-47) links, A-XDR data, OBIS codes, AARQ/AARE with no, low (password) or high (GMAC) authentication, GET/SET/ACTION with block transfer and selective access, security suite 0 ciphering (AES-GCM), a client for meters and a meter simulator (registers, clock, load profile, disconnect control). The codec is mirrored by a fuzzed Rust crate through shared conformance vectors. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
